<p class="lead">The insurance adjuster salary Florida carriers and independent firms pay is driven by one thing above all: hurricanes. Florida has more coastline exposed to Atlantic and Gulf storms than any other state in the continental US, a massive inventory of insured homes, and a property market that never stops producing roof, water and wind claims. That creates strong pay for staff adjusters and big, but uneven, earnings for independent and CAT adjusters.</p>

