<h2 id="insurance-adjuster-salary-florida-by-role">Insurance adjuster salary: Florida pay by role</h2>
<p>The Bureau of Labor Statistics puts the national median for claims adjusters, appraisers, examiners and investigators at $76,790 a year as of May 2024. Florida staff pay runs roughly near that median. The difference in Florida is the mix of work: property adjusters are in heavier demand than in most states, and the ceiling for storm-focused independents is unusually high.</p>

